{"author": "binder-manager", "approver": "delegated-authority-lead", "binder_id": "binder_E", "doctrine_note": "E-009/E-010 are encoded per system doctrine (BFR-APP-003 Must): ABSENT data yields Cannot-assess/Refer, never Decline. This deliberately differs from the literal Appendix-A text for E rules 9-10, which is flagged OPEN-10 awaiting a business owner. Present-but-negative values (e.g. loss_run_provided=false) still Decline literally.", "effective_from": "2026-10-15", "effective_to": null, "notes": ["E-007 standard-format list is a business placeholder (OPEN): {CIF+10%, SELLING_PRICE}.", "E-005 flood-tier codes are a placeholder until the enrichment source is licensed (OPEN-6).", "E-006 splits into four independent conditions (OR-equivalent at binder level)."], "rules": [{"binder_id": "binder_E", "business_description": "If any coverage section exceeds $4,000,000", "category": "Coverage Section Limit", "field_reference": "coverage_sections.limit", "operator": "lte", "rule_id": "E-001-SECTION-LIMIT", "scope": "submission", "severity": "refer", "threshold_unit": "currency", "threshold_value": 4000000}, {"binder_id": "binder_E", "business_description": "If the total insured value exceeds $12,500,000", "category": "Total Insured Value", "field_reference": "total_insured_value", "operator": "lte", "rule_id": "E-002-TIV", "scope": "submission", "severity": "refer", "threshold_unit": "currency", "threshold_value": 12500000}, {"binder_id": "binder_E", "business_description": "If there are any claims reported in the past 3 years", "category": "Loss History", "field_reference": "claim_count_3_years", "operator": "eq", "rule_id": "E-003-CLAIMS-3Y", "scope": "submission", "severity": "refer", "threshold_unit": "count", "threshold_value": 0}, {"binder_id": "binder_E", "business_description": "If the insured is located in Florida or Texas", "category": "Insured Address", "field_reference": "insured_state_province", "operator": "not_in", "rule_id": "E-004-FL-TX", "scope": "submission", "severity": "refer", "threshold_unit": "code", "threshold_value": ["FL", "TEXAS", "TX"]}, {"binder_id": "binder_E", "business_description": "If any location is in a Tier 3 flood zone", "category": "Location Geography", "field_reference": "locations.flood_tier", "operator": "not_in", "rule_id": "E-005-FLOOD-TIER", "scope": "location", "severity": "refer", "threshold_unit": "code", "threshold_value": ["TIER_3", "TIER3", "3"]}, {"binder_id": "binder_E", "business_description": "Wood frame construction (part 1 of 4)", "category": "Construction / COPE", "field_reference": "locations.construction_type", "operator": "not_in", "rule_id": "E-006a-WOOD-FRAME", "scope": "location", "severity": "refer", "threshold_unit": "code", "threshold_value": ["WOOD", "WOOD_FRAME"]}, {"binder_id": "binder_E", "business_description": "Mixed roofing (part 2 of 4)", "category": "Construction / COPE", "field_reference": "locations.roofing_type", "operator": "not_in", "rule_id": "E-006b-MIXED-ROOF", "scope": "location", "severity": "refer", "threshold_unit": "code", "threshold_value": ["MIXED", "MIXED_ROOFING"]}, {"binder_id": "binder_E", "business_description": "Lacks CCTV (part 3 of 4)", "category": "Construction / COPE", "field_reference": "locations.cctv_present", "operator": "is_true", "rule_id": "E-006c-CCTV", "scope": "location", "severity": "refer", "threshold_unit": "boolean", "threshold_value": true}, {"binder_id": "binder_E", "business_description": "Lacks alarm system (part 4 of 4)", "category": "Construction / COPE", "field_reference": "locations.alarm_present", "operator": "is_true", "rule_id": "E-006d-ALARM", "scope": "location", "severity": "refer", "threshold_unit": "boolean", "threshold_value": true}, {"binder_id": "binder_E", "business_description": "If the valuation method is in a non-standard format", "category": "Valuation Method", "field_reference": "valuation_basis", "operator": "in", "rule_id": "E-007-VALUATION", "scope": "submission", "severity": "refer", "threshold_unit": "code", "threshold_value": ["CIF+10%", "SELLING_PRICE"]}, {"binder_id": "binder_E", "business_description": "If the requested policy start date is in the past", "category": "Coverage Type / Term", "field_reference": "requested_inception_date", "operator": "after", "rule_id": "E-008-INCEPTION", "scope": "submission", "severity": "refer", "threshold_unit": "date", "threshold_value": "TODAY"}, {"binder_id": "binder_E", "business_description": "If the submission is missing a loss run (doctrine: absent refers, OPEN-10)", "category": "Submission Quality", "field_reference": "loss_run_provided", "operator": "is_true", "rule_id": "E-009a-LOSS-RUN", "scope": "submission", "severity": "refer", "threshold_unit": "boolean", "threshold_value": true}, {"binder_id": "binder_E", "business_description": "If the broker name is missing (doctrine: absent refers, OPEN-10)", "category": "Submission Quality", "field_reference": "broker_name", "operator": "is_present", "rule_id": "E-009b-BROKER", "scope": "submission", "severity": "refer", "threshold_unit": "string", "threshold_value": null}, {"binder_id": "binder_E", "business_description": "If the ZIP code is missing (doctrine: absent refers, OPEN-10)", "category": "Submission Quality", "field_reference": "insured_postcode_zip", "operator": "is_present", "rule_id": "E-009c-ZIP", "scope": "submission", "severity": "refer", "threshold_unit": "string", "threshold_value": null}, {"binder_id": "binder_E", "business_description": "If the construction year is missing from the SOV (doctrine: absent refers, OPEN-10)", "category": "Location Count / Setup", "field_reference": "locations.year_built", "operator": "is_present", "rule_id": "E-010a-YEAR-BUILT", "scope": "location", "severity": "refer", "threshold_unit": "year", "threshold_value": null}, {"binder_id": "binder_E", "business_description": "If COPE details are missing from the SOV (doctrine: absent refers, OPEN-10)", "category": "Location Count / Setup", "field_reference": "